_6k._0B1=false;_8y1(_6k,_7k,_6k._9W1,_6k._aW1);_6k._qQ1=(_To([0,0,0,0,0]));_6k._rQ1=(_To([0,0,0,0,0]));_6k._WW1=(_To([0,0]));_6k._XW1=(_To([0,0]));_6k._YW1=(_To([0,0]));_6k._ZW1=(_To([0,0,0,0,0]));_6k._qy=0;_6k.__W1=0;_6k._0X1=0;_6k._1X1=(_To([_Kl(_6k,(global._2X1=_ek(_6k,_3X1)),(_To([6,3,2026])),(_To(["Here's another big patch! I was gonna wait a few days to push this one but a pretty big bug regarding a certain hand was discovered (it basically made its gimmick not work lol) so I decided to push it as it is. I've included a good amount of QoL features you've been asking for, and also reworked Alphabet Block!\r\nhope you enjoy, let me know your opinions on this one :)\r\n(still thinking on the boss reroll mechanic, I'll have something for testing on a beta branch by next week ;))\r\nhave a good weekend!\r\n\r\nDice Balance:\r\n- Reworked Alphabet Block:\r\nNow instead of the effect, permanently copies the face value of a nearby die, making it useful for copying high faced dice\r\n-Magic 8 Ball is now rare\r\n- Mono Token is now always face 0, and triggers its effect mid roll, similar to how Mimic Die works.\r\n\r\nBoss Balance:\r\n- Reduced The Dusty's explosive area\r\n",
"QoL:\r\n- Reworked the extra dice spawn code, should be more consistent overall and trigger dice copies in their intended order, as well as eliminating infinite loops (I tried doing this a couple of patches ago but broke the code accidentally and just decided to quickly revert the changes and revisit this later)\r\n- You can now press A on your keyboard to use autoselect (if enabled)\r\n- Added up and down arrows to stats on the hand select menu alongside green/red colors, for accesibility reasons\r\n- You can now click on select dots on the hand select menu to quickly scroll through the hands\r\n- Added a safety delay when trying to roll with no dice on controller, to avoid accidental rolls\r\n\r\nBugfixes:\r\n- Fixed Bicolor Hand main mechanic being broken\r\n- Fixed NaN score not resetting while in The Vortex\r\n- Fixed not being able to buy dice with NaN score\r\n- Fixed buying something with NaN price not subtracting anything to your score\r\n- Fixed shattered die resetting your score when buying with NaN\r\n- Fixed the Power VI Blue Hand unlock not always unlocking as intended",
"- Fixed Sudoku and Dicecoin not unlocking when having Skip Animations on\r\n- Fixed Skip Rolls button spawning in unintended places when loading a run\r\n- Fixed Ruby Stamps from chests having the silver sprite\r\n- Fixed Tesseract and Magnetic Die creating an infinite loop"]))),_Kl(_6k,(global._4X1=_ek(_6k,_5X1)),(_To([5,3,2026])),(_To(["quick patch addressing some major issues that were left in the previous patch, still working on that balance update ;)\r\n\r\n- Made a certain curse-applying die behave the same way as I made The Witch in last patch with the Fragile curse (doesn't destroy during that first roll)\r\n\r\n- Fixed bosses permanently changing to + version after viewing them in the collection\r\n- Fixed rarities showing up as ''???'' in the collection\r\n- Fixed Vortex unlock not saving properly \r\n- Fixed Aquarium counting as odd even when not rolled for a certain hand\r\n- Fixed echo Aquarium/Anchor not working properly\r\n- Fixed Hero's Mark not working with Aquarium/Anchor in hand\r\n- Fixed Casino Die not properly working with D100/D666/Piñata\r\n- Fixed NaN highscore not displaying on the menu"]))),
_Kl(_6k,(global._6X1=_ek(_6k,_7X1)),(_To([4,3,2026])),(_To(["Here's another big patch! This time I focused on fixing a shit ton of bugs and added a couple of QoL features as well as some balance changes. After this one I feel like the game should be pretty stable in terms on bugs and niche interactions, so I'll focus on just balance for the next patch (might take a bit longer to do!)\r\nWith this update I should have made the stamp requirement for unlocking Pale Hand more easily obtainable, which was something a lot of you asked for. Let me know if there are still any bosses or bad items you'd wanna see changed :)\r\nalso, I'm still giving a lot of thought on how and if I want to add a boss reroll mechanic, I'll keep you posted on that!\r\n\r\nBalance changes:\r\n- Silver Stamps now give +0.3 stamp multiplier\r\n- Sealed Letter card buffed from 0.2 to 0.4 stamp multiplier \r\n- If The Witch boss adds the Fragile curse to a die, it now doesn't directly destroy on that roll\r\n- Hero's Mark now ignores dice or stuff already on the table, only taking into account if you specifically rolled 1 die \r\n",
"Other changes:\r\n- Added a ''new'' tooltip for newly discovered items in the collection \r\n- Added a bunch of ''wrap around'' features for navigating through various menus with a controller\r\n- Having Skip Animations setting on now skips the little delay when donating stars on the boss shop\r\n- Added missing translations for Portuguese, Chinese and French\r\n- Blue Hand now actually has 6 fingers in all their sprites lol\r\n\r\nBugfixes:\r\n- Fixed Friendship Ring sometimes not working properly\r\n- Fixed not being able to buy anything with NaN score\r\n- Lucky Blocks spawned from Echo Cube didn't transform into anything\r\n- Fixed a couple of spelling errors\r\n- Fixed Prime Ring having unncessary calculations which led to some lag\r\n- Fixed area effects visually pointing towards discarded or deactivated dice, even if they didn't trigger anything\r\n- Fixed Mini-AWP sometimes not being able to discard some dice if there were too many on the board\r\n- Fixed you being able to see descriptions on discarded dice\r\n",
"- Fixed Isaac Die not triggering its 5 effect if it was rerolled by itself by rolling a 1\r\n- Fixed the screen permanently turning brighter if you exited a certain secret shop while an animation was playing\r\n- Changed the priority order on Emerald to trigger later in the roll\r\n- Fixed a game freeze when trying to use a transform card on a marble while having a lot of them\r\n- Fixed deactivated spintop still placing itself on the table\r\n- Fixed Isaac's Die rerolling D666 and D100 even if they didn't roll their lowest face\r\n- Fixed fire not properly gainging extra value when it should\r\n- Fixed Skip Rolls button not appearing for the first turn when loading into a run\r\n- Fixed a crash involving certain dice on the Blackout boss\r\n- Fixed the ''+'' missing from cutscenes on +bosses "]))),
_Kl(_6k,(global._8X1=_ek(_6k,_9X1)),(_To([2,3,2026])),(_To(["another day, another patch! there's a new really cool buff to both Fire Die and Red Giant which I feel will enable a ton of synergies, and this one also has the first nerf of the game! E.T. Die... some people were breaking the game too hard and too easily with it lol. as always, let me know what do you think!\r\n\r\nChanges:\r\n- Fire Die and Red Giant are now immune to burns\r\n- E.T. Die can now only store 1 copy of each dice\r\n- You can now press F12 to take screenshots on Steam\r\n- Removed the add to the Steam wishlist button on the main menu\r\n- Added a backup system that saves everytime you open the game, stores up to 5 past instances of the data (located at AppData > Local > dice_a_million > default > backup) \r\n\r\nBugfixes:\r\n- The Starving boss took too much dice per turn in Dice Rush\r\n- Fixed NaN score not working properly in boss round stars and in new best from a run\r\n- Fixed Magic 8 Ball not working properly while having Equity Ring\r\n"]))),
_Kl(_6k,(global._aX1=_ek(_6k,_bX1)),(_To([1,3,2026])),(_To(["\r\nHey there! Smaller patch today, mostly addressing bugs and crashes, I still managed to fit in a couple of gameplay changes, but this is not the 2nd Balance Patch, that will come in a few days.\r\nThanks so much for the response and all the feedback, it's been a bit overwhelming to me, but I feel the love and passion! even in the criticism ;)\r\n\r\nAnyways here are all the changes:\r\n\r\n- The Patient boss now deactivates half of your dice instead of all of them\r\n- The Patient boss is now banned on the ''Peanuts!'' challenge\r\n- Echo Hourglass works properly now (but rolling multiple of them still does nothing)\r\n- Beating bosses in Dice Rush now counts towards unlocks for beating them\r\n- Extra spawned dice and stuff on the table (like fire and notes) can now be exhausted, disappearing and triggering any exhaust effects\r\n- Added French and Russian translations for changes in 1.0.14",
"Bugfixes:\r\n- Ink Die change from latest patch wasn't actually working lol\r\n- Fixed Magic 8 Ball not working with Dada Die\r\n- Master Volume didn't save if turned down to 0\r\n- Fixed not being able to go into Dice Rush after rolling the dice on the map and then skipping the round\r\n- Fixed a crash when exiting on the Dice Rush rewards\r\n- Fixed a rare crash that could happen when checking the map\r\n- Fixed a certain boss not advancing its phase when scoring NaN\r\n- You couldn't skip rewards on a certain secret chest\r\n- Spring didn't work with dice rolled by a certain boss\r\n- Fixed a minor error on the Russian translation\r\n- Curses gotten through The Witch boss didn't count towards the collection\r\n- Enchantment icons didn't show up in the collection if you have never picked up a D6\r\n- Fixed equity ring still working on some niche interactions even when deactivated\r\n- Fixed a crash that happened when a boss tried to deactivate an Alphabet Block transformed into a Rubik's Cube piece (my god that's specific lol)\r\n- Fixed a bunch of controller related crashes\r\n"]))),
_Kl(_6k,(global._cX1=_ek(_6k,_dX1)),(_To([28,2,2026])),(_To(["Hey all! I heard you loud and clear, difficulty needs some adjustment. So I made some changes.\r\nThis is the first balance patch, I know a lot of you mentioned bosses being harsh in your comments, but I decided to focus on dice and general balance for this first update.\r\nI'm still thinking on how to implement a mechanic that lets you reroll bosses, since I feel like that would be the best way to tackle this problem, but for now, I'll let you guys tell me if you find this new version more forgiving overall! (I did nerf a couple of bosses tho ;))\r\n\r\nThe major thing I did here is the first line in the general balance section. It may not seem like much but trust me that makes the whole experience sooo much smoother.\r\nAgain, super open to any feedback, let me know what you guys think of these changes, and what else would you like! :)\r\n\r\nNote: some of the changes are not still properly translated to any languages besides english and spanish but I decided to prioritize gameplay changes first, so you'll see them in english for now, hope you don't mind!\r\n",
"General Balance:\r\n- Starter dice (Bottlecap, D3, D4 and D6) can no longer appear in any rewards or shops during a run\r\n- Dice in shops/rewards now slightly up in rarity as you progress through the run\r\n- Tweaked the code that spawns extra dice, should be behaving more consistently with dice like dumbbell\r\n- Extra dice spawned from other dice now inherit their extra value (i.e. Die of Dice)\r\n- Dice Rush now resets effects from the previous boss when going into the next one (like fires from Pyro, deactivations from Capricious, and etc)\r\n- Some bosses like The Patient, The Gluton and The Cautious can no longer appear in Dice Rush\r\n\r\nDice Balance:\r\n- Pocket Pencil buffed from 4X to 6X\r\n- Foam Dice now gives +5 extra value to nearby dice, as well as exhausting them\r\n- Ancient Die now guarantees a legendary die\r\n- Made Fibonacci's Die limit higher (previously it was 610, now it's 1597)\r\n- D10 buffed from +1 to +2 extra value per die on the table\r\n- Red Giant buffed from +1 to +3 face value per trigger",
"- Ivory Die buffed from +0.1 to +0.2 stamp multiplier\r\n- Ink Die buffed from +0.2 to +0.5 stamp multiplier\r\n- Wooden Die buffed from +2 to +4 extra value\r\n- Magic Sponge now removes curses from dice, but destroys itself when it does so\r\n\r\nRing Balance:\r\n- Fishbone Charm buffed from +2 to +4 extra value\r\n- Square Ring now always gives a random card at the start of a new round\r\n\r\nBoss Balance:\r\n- The Frost boss no longer deactivates one of your dice\r\n- The Envious got reworked. Its previous effect is now its plus version, the normal one now discards dice that rolled their highest face, making it quite less punishing.\r\n- The Copycat got reworked. Its previous effect is now its plus version, the normal one now divides dice with a repeated face by the number of dice with that face, making it like an inverse version of the Equivalent Link ring.\r\n- The Cautious boss can no longer spawn on Yellow Hand runs \r\n\r\nHands Balance:\r\n- White Hand now starts with 2 less D3\r\n",
"Bugfixes:\r\n- Echo didn't work on Fibonacci's Die\r\n- Fibonacci's Die didn't work with Conservative Ring despite having 6 faces \r\n- Casino Die effect didn't work as intended when using the One Ring\r\n- The Frost boss always froze 0 on Fibonacci's Die, regardless of your current face layout\r\n- Certain hand couldn't get intended dice at the start\r\n- Fixed an error on the French translation regarding Haste Ring (and other minor ones)\r\n- Fixed a couple of color errors on the Russian translation \r\n- Fixed a visual bug on the dice score popup\r\n- Magic 8 Ball didn't work properly with Sudoku, Bottle of Caps and other specific combos\r\n- Fixed a crash when checking the map on a certain really advanced purple place\r\n- No flashbang mode didn't affect certain flashbang cutscenes\r\n- Fixed a crash involving NaNeinf and Vampire Die\r\n- Fixed a softlock when using a Choose Face card with a dice too low in your selection\r\n- Fixed the phone round end popup still briefly appearing when Skip Animations setting is on\r\n- Fixed rings being able to appear on chests on the Ringless challenge\r\n- Fixed a crash when pressing rb and lb at the same time on a controller"]))),
_Kl(_6k,(global._eX1=_ek(_6k,_fX1)),(_To([26,2,2026])),(_To(["welcome to a first round of patches! this one comes with a couple of translation errors fixed as well as some QoL features and a bunch of bugfixes.\r\nthanks so much for the overwhelmly positive support on the launch, means the world to me :)\r\n\r\nQoL:\r\n- Added a ''No-Flashbang Mode'' to the graphic settings to prevent flashbangs from removing dice ;)\r\n- You can now click ''Retry'' on the setting menu instead of holding if you're on the starter pack selection screen\r\n\r\nBalance:\r\n- Toned down a bit the roll scaling on a certain new hand\r\n\r\nBugfixes:\r\n- Fixed ''This roll'' tooltip on rings having some layering problems\r\n- Fixed errors on the Chinese translation for the Transform card and The Witch boss\r\n- Fixed errors on the French translation for The Hollow boss, The Patient boss, and other minor ones\r\n- Fixed Enchants not being visible in the collection if you had never taken a D6",
"- Fixed not being able to see area or info on dice on a trade event\r\n- Fixed Enchant rooms not working properly if you had less than 3 dice in your bag\r\n- FIxed a crash involving Dicecoin\r\n- Fixed certain Boss variations not properly showing up in the collection\r\n- Fixed Fibonacci Die not displaying correctly when gotten from a chest\r\n- Added a small cooldown when closing map/dice manu to prevent accidentally clicking stuff\r\n- Fixed ''Carlos was here'' challenge being unlocked even with Green Hand locked\r\n- Fixed Red Giant gaining value even when discarded or deactivated\r\n- Fixed a rare crash involving Lucky Block and a new certain card\r\n- Fixed a bunch of controller related crashes\r\n- Fixed a crash while trying to read info on some enchantments\r\n"]))),
_Kl(_6k,(global._gX1=_ek(_6k,_hX1)),(_To([25,2,2026])),(_To(["Hello everyone! Welcome finally to [rainbow]Dice A Million 1.0[/rainbow]! I cleared up the old patch notes from the demo so we can have a fresh start. There's obviously a lot that has changed, but for the sake of simplicity and not spoiling anything, I won't be listing any changes.\r\n\r\nThere's of course new dice, rings, bosses, etc, but also new paths, hands to play as and tons of improvements (and secrets...). I hope you have lots of fun and lots of game overs! Really hope you enjoy everything I've put into this game :)\r\n\r\nSee you on the actual first patch!"])))]));
